    {
      "id": "claim_e4ca8a546fe54236b01e06f27aa14a38",
      "statement": "Firm guidance requires a documented eligibility determination before any private-markets strategy is offered; eligibility is a regulatory determination outside portfolio-manager discretion, and a private-markets commitment for an ineligible client cannot be cleared by approval.",
